    "chunk_text": "& biscope. Gif preost o\u00f0rum on unriht on fultume beo, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost o\u00f0rum rihtes fultumes forwyrne, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost o\u00f0erne unwarnode l\u00e6te \u00fe\u00e6s, \u00fee he wite, \u00fe\u00e6t him hearmian wille, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost sceare misgime beardes o\u00f0\u00f0e feaxes, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost cwenan forl\u00e6te & o\u00f0re nime, anathema sit. Gif preost on gesetne timan tida ne ringe o\u00f0\u00f0e tida ne singe, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost mid w\u00e6pnum innan circan cume, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost misendebirde ciriclice gear\u00feenunga, d\u00e6ges o\u00f0\u00f0e nihtes, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost ordol misfadige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost searwa\u00f0 bewinde, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost oferdruncen lufige o\u00f0\u00f0e gliman o\u00f0\u00f0e ealascop wur\u00f0e, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost forhele, hw\u00e6t on his scriftscire betweox mannum to unrihte rixige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost geargerihta unmynegode l\u00e6te, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost sino\u00f0 forbuge, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost to rihte gebugan nelle, ac ongean biscopes ger\u00e6dnesse wi\u00f0erige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0\u00f0e beo he Gif hwa Godes lage o\u00f0\u00f0e folclage wirde, gebete hit georne. Ealle we sculon \u00e6nne God wur\u00f0ian & lufian & \u00e6nne Cristendom georne healdan & \u00e6lcne h\u00e6\u00feendom Gif \u00feonne \ufffd",
